      "widgets_values": [
        "N-38 Face Detect Lite (YuNet GPU) — fast face detector, drop-in for N-10.\n\nlandmarks_json uses the same 5-point order as N-10 and feeds the Facial Aligner directly. face_mask is a ready-made box mask (shown with N-43 Mask Preview). bbox_json carries the real per-face confidence. Keep detect_size at 640 for portraits; raise it (max 1024) only for group shots with small faces. Weights (~0.4 MB) download on first use."
      ]
    }
